WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.804 --> 00:00:07.631
1. Open Renewals in your account.

2
00:00:07.631 --> 00:00:18.480
2. Check what is overdue and what renews in the next 30 and 90 days.

3
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:24.711
3. Tick the services and domains you want to renew.

4
00:00:24.711 --> 00:00:33.476
4. Click Renew in the bar at the bottom, then pay everything you ticked on one invoice.
